  "pocoProvisioningTourTitle": "POCO WALKTHROUGH",
  "pocoProvisioningWaitingForSource": "I am waiting for your VPS to report its exact source commit. Once it does, I can show you the code actually being installed.",
  "pocoProvisioningLoadingSource": "I found the exact release commit. I am fetching its public provisioning code so we can inspect it together.",
